        "text": "=You are a regulatory watch assistant for bank risk teams.\nTopics followed by the user: {{ $json.topics }}\nPublication title: {{ $json.title }}\nPublication URL : {{ $json.link }}\n\nRate the relevance of this publication to these topics from 0 to 10, name the matched topic (or \"none\"), and write a one-sentence summary.\nReply ONLY with JSON, no other text:\n{\"score\": 0, \"matched_topic\": \"\", \"summary\": \"\"}",
